{
  "schema": "hexon-heldout-eval-v1",
  "created": "2026-10-15",
  "description": "Held-out evaluation set for Hexon models. Two subsets: (A) the original 8-item keyword check, retained for continuity but contaminated for hexon-1.2 (those exact questions were used in its 14-pair fine-tune, so its score there is NOT valid evidence); (B) a fresh held-out set of questions that appear in no Hexon training corpus. Set B is the only set that supports model-vs-model comparison.",
  "scoring_notes": [
    "must_include is a list of ALIAS GROUPS. Each group is a list of alternative case-insensitive regexes; at least one regex in each group must match. All groups must be satisfied for the item to count as correct (AND over groups, OR within a group).",
    "must_not is a list of case-insensitive regexes; a match marks the item as a hallucination.",
    "unsupported_number is computed only for items with check_unsupported_number=true: any number in the response that appears neither in the question nor in the reference. It is a noisy proxy and is reported separately, never folded into accuracy."
  ],
  "sets": [
